./docs

# Design exports and scratch photos. Three of the rules that used to sit here
# never matched anything: `/mobile/docs` resolves to mobile/mobile/docs from
# this file, and a `./` prefix is not a thing git parses — the leading dot just
# makes the pattern literal, so `./docs` looked for a directory named ".".
# That is how the two Onboarding PNGs in docs/ got tracked.
/docs
/image

# The .vscode folder contains launch configuration and tasks you configure in
# VS Code which you may wish to be included in version control, so this line
# is commented out by default.
#.vscode/

